@zirkelc you could try this instead, it works for me:
```
  //Terminal binding fixes
  {
      "key": "shift+enter",
      "command": "workbench.action.terminal.sendSequence",
      "args": {
          // backlink to explanation: https://github.com/sst/opencode/issues/1505#issuecomment-3411334883
          "text": "\u001b[13;2u"
      },
      "when": "terminalFocus"
  },
```

This works for both cursor and vscode.
